{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an adventure role-playing game with quest elements, a uncomplicated trading system, turn-based combat, romantic stories, team building, character customization, and real-time travel through a dynamic world with day and night cycles. Play as two main characters, Jacob or Vetta, and see how their stories converge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in early access, and many of these features are already available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We start in the pirate era with ships and treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But since this is a game, we are free to unlock the space-time continuum for a rich immersion into adventure. Welcome aboard, Captain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some things are still being tested and may be changed or improved during development, such as quests, characters, or the storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2987560?t=1761555208","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987560/17789f3847f6876227c7edf88e4884a90a703045/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761555208","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987560/2b7ea700483cd0fad280cb159ee636b9b4a5a2a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761555208","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987560/2b7ea700483cd0fad280cb159ee636b9b4a5a2a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761555208","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Game is in development. And at this stage (v0.180) with Maxi activated, all sex scence are cutted, from the game at the moment. Only nudes bodies, like undress.\r\n \r\nIf there are any sex option are added only in a gental way, romantic way. But now there is nothing of it.\r\nGame has cheat option that allows to get some items.\r\nThis cheat option is gonna be extended in time."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an adventure role-playing game with quest elements, a uncomplicated trading system, turn-based combat, romantic stories, team building, character customization, and real-time travel through a dynamic world with day and night cycles. Play as two main characters, Jacob or Vetta, and see how their stories converge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in early access, and many of these features are already available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We start in the pirate era with ships and treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But since this is a game, we are free to unlock the space-time continuum for a rich immersion into adventure. Welcome aboard, Captain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some things are still being tested and may be changed or improved during development, such as quests, characters, or the storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["Insexsity_team","Insexsity_team","Insexsity","Insexsity_team"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987560/23ede3d5bca02bb2f9c58ee2666a16dd0d226821/header.jpg?t=1761555208","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> almost any with graphic support<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86_64<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><b